  "descriptionHtml": "<h1>SPECIFICATIONS</h1><p><span>Brand Name</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">CINESSD</span></p><p><span>CN</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">Jiangsu</span></p><p><span>Choice</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">yes</span></p><p><span>Craft of Weaving</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">Tatting</span></p><p><span>Dresses Length</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">Knee-Length</span></p><p><span>Gender</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">Women</span></p><p><span>High-concerned chemical</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">none</span></p><p><span>Item Type</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">Nightgowns</span></p><p><span>Material</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">Silk</span></p><p><span>Model No.</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">HHBDYZ-001</span></p><p><span>Obscene Picture</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">No</span></p><p><span>Origin</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">Mainland China</span></p><p><span>Season</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">summer</span></p><p><span>Sexually Suggestive</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">No</span></p><p><span>Style</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">basics</span></p><p><span>semi_Choice</span>: <span style=\"color:#333\">yes</span></p><div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;line-height:28px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\">100% Mulberry Silk Sleep Mask for Man and Woman</p>\n<p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\">Grade 6A, 100% pure, organic and long fiber mulberry silk on both sides.<br><br>100% mulberry silk covered elastic band,giving silk care to your hair without entangling them.<br><br>Product Dimensions: 20*8.5cm. It covers all eyes-area and there is no leaking of light even in nose area.<br><br>Package: Bubble bag . (not giftbox-packaged)</p>\n</